  "decoded_text": "<|im_system|>tool_declare<|im_middle|># Tools\n\n## functions\nnamespace functions {\n// Return a deterministic weather snapshot.\ntype get_weather = (_: {\n  // City to check.\n  city: string,\n  // Day label such as today or tomorrow.\n  day: string\n}) => any;\n// Estimate deterministic travel time for a route.\ntype estimate_travel = (_: {\n  // Departure window label.\n  depart_window: string,\n  // Destination location.\n  destination: string,\n  // Starting location.\n  origin: string\n}) => any;\n// Reserve a meeting room with an explicit time range.\ntype reserve_room = (_: {\n  // Room name.\n  room: string,\n  // Local start time.\n  start_time: string,\n  // Local end time.\n  end_time?: string | null\n}) => any;\n// Look up an incident status.\ntype lookup_incident = (_: {\n  // Incident id in INC-#### format.\n  incident_id: string\n}) => any;\n}\n<|im_end|><|im_system|>system<|im_middle|>You coordinate clinic deliveries and summarize tradeoffs briefly.<|im_end|><|im_user|>user<|im_middle|>Compare morning deliveries from Depot A to the West and East clinics, then compare the afternoon Depot B options. Use weather and travel estimates before recommending a route.<|im_end|><|im_assistant|>assistant<|im_middle|><think></think>I will check the morning route and destination weather together.<|tool_calls_section_begin|><|tool_call_begin|>call_travel_west<|tool_call_argument_begin|>{\"origin\": \"Depot A\", \"destination\": \"West Clinic\", \"depart_window\": \"morning\"}<|tool_call_end|><|tool_call_begin|>call_weather_denver<|tool_call_argument_begin|>{\"city\": \"Denver\", \"day\": \"tomorrow\"}<|tool_call_end|><|tool_calls_section_end|><|im_end|><|im_system|>tool<|im_middle|>## Return of call_travel_west\n{\"route\":\"Depot A->West Clinic\",\"depart_window\":\"morning\",\"minutes\":32,\"risk\":\"low\"}<|im_end|><|im_system|>tool<|im_middle|>## Return of call_weather_denver\n{\"city\":\"Denver\",\"day\":\"tomorrow\",\"condition\":\"clear\